{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03DR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}^a$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}^a$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:96abc7aeddc2384e2f8ef6b1eec9c19793f886ad23d7e979a16bcfb4635a896f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8e00ece000105372e6622a1fd321e490afb91ab4c13440a78353b82792682de4", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nNote how we use the same notation <MATH_0001> in each case.\nNo confusion can really arise from this as by definition the rule\nthat defines the sheaf <MATH_0002> is independent of the site\nwe choose to look at.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9ab377290e9d01560259b80b1e43a22fd640e2603483671333a793fe49ac2146", "unit_id": "tag:03DR:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "03DR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S_{Zar}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0005": "$(S_{Zar}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0006": "$(S, \\mathcal{O}_S)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-Zariski-usual}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-Zariski-site-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:983559831000bd4c3bf6d0c7f82aed13ec562b098a4edcde8de4295a33af7004", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:de72370252e68835df80a9078d784c00250574445986af530ca079d2e6852012", "source_text": "In Topologies, Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe have seen that the small Zariski site of a scheme <MATH_0001> is\nequivalent to <MATH_0002> as a topological space in the sense that the\ncategories of sheaves are naturally equivalent. Now that <MATH_0003>\nis also endowed with a structure sheaf <MATH_0004> we see\nthat sheaves of modules on the ringed site <MATH_0005>\nagree with sheaves of modules on the ringed space <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d067c1b80901441ebe8681f70f07d27a1ab971f7d455d4c3fe0d96c8616b0eba", "unit_id": "tag:03FG:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "03DR", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f : T \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f_{sites}$", "MATH_0003": "$f_{sites} : (\\Sch/T)_\\tau \\to (\\Sch/S)_{\\tau'}$", "MATH_0004": "$f_{sites} : (\\Sch/S)_\\tau \\to S_{\\tau'}$", "MATH_0005": "$S'/S \\mapsto T \\times_S S'/S$", "MATH_0006": "$S'/S$", "MATH_0007": "$$\nf_{sites}^\\sharp :\n\\mathcal{O}(S'/S)\n\\longrightarrow\nf_{sites, *}\\mathcal{O}(S'/S) =\n\\mathcal{O}(T \\times_S S'/T)\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$\\text{pr}_{S'}^\\sharp : \\mathcal{O}(S') \\to \\mathcal{O}(T \\times_S S')$", "MATH_0009": "$i_f : \\Sh(T_\\tau) \\to \\Sh((\\Sch/S)_\\tau)$", "MATH_0010": "$\\tau \\in \\{Zar, \\etale\\}$", "MATH_0011": "$i_f^{-1}\\mathcal{O} = \\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0012": "$f_{big} : (\\Sch/X)_{fppf} \\to (\\Sch/Y)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0013": "$$\n(f_{big}, f_{big}^\\sharp) :\n((\\Sch/X)_{fppf}, \\mathcal{O}_X)\n\\longrightarrow\n((\\Sch/Y)_{fppf}, \\mathcal{O}_Y)\n$$", "MATH_0014": "$f_{small} : X_\\etale \\to Y_\\etale$", "MATH_0015": "$$\n(f_{small}, f_{small}^\\sharp) :\n(X_\\etale, \\mathcal{O}_X)\n\\longrightarrow\n(Y_\\etale, \\mathcal{O}_Y)\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topologies-section-change-topologies}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-put-in-T}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-put-in-T-etale}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{sites-modules-definition-ringed-site}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{sites-modules-definition-ringed-site}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-change-topologies-ringed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e32655db74f39b8b8d65c6300b7e25f26ce2e08ba8e37ca84e4f1c043368f962", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:74f8ba8774b1fb7916d57a76f754217498cdf334764c89cf7